      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STREAMLINED (1) won well from the back two starts ago before being a touch disappointing when over 1800m here last week. Out to 2200m now, but it doesn't look an issue on what he'd done previously. Racing in good order and has the most upside of this field. Can bounce back to winning ways. I LOVE YA MONEY (3) stuck on well behind All Grunt here last week over this distance where he seemed to have every chance. The winkers replace the blinkers now and Nottle's claim comes in handy as he drops back in grade. Showed he can handle the quick turnaround last start and rates highly again. CAPABLE ANGEL (7) flew over the top in an easier race last start at Belmont, scoring in dominant fashion over 2100m. Tougher now, but that figure stacks up and this looks to shape similarly. Watch for her flying late in the race. DANDY'S GEM (8) can find the front and give them something to catch. DARK LOOKS (2) won't be far away on her recent efforts.",
